                    <signifLet xml:id="m-554891c7-b295-4513-a5aa-9ce81b7b3bc5" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-06585caa-e906-4626-975e-2035b35ed037" facs="#m-e32cfe90-70dd-4ce3-8ccf-8919fc8fda8e" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-d94009f7-798d-4b9b-a47b-98ae85cf459c">
            <lg xml:id="m-2d887ccc-d3d0-4217-94ab-6f38f138776d">
              <l xml:id="m-ead1f674-abc9-4087-9284-bdb2c498e752" facs="#m-3707e31e-7105-4118-9ce4-8a1d5375fbd0" label="ambiguous">1351°</l><l xml:id="m-815171d7-db06-46d3-ad44-b6b6a9371834" facs="#m-91242097-6907-4443-a1ce-edc5f37c378e" label="ambiguous">Ianuary 29.</l><l xml:id="m-5a4317ad-535e-4b98-9327-5066c8167c0b" facs="#m-9f1f9bdd-82c2-4cf3-8a2d-09796477ac67" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Laudis tibi. and Postcommunion. Refécti cibo. p. 1208.</l><l xml:id="m-62846057-a671-4cac-ab70-d8218d22d1b7" facs="#m-d15ee3e8-97ea-47cd-ac0e-bdc46ab979e4" label="text-like">Commemoration or St. Agnes, Virgin and Martyr, second.</l><l xml:id="m-44b1beb7-52cd-4d02-abdb-f7e3334539f1" facs="#m-7051eb6c-7e06-4708-8909-957f8ecf5f41" label="text-like">At First Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-152e9f9b-42c6-4c9e-be7f-653abb7d976f" facs="#m-03e95504-1996-4a43-bb08-8c82d04cc207" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-eeb3aa31-5d4b-42cb-aaaf-7b2132de406a" facs="#m-8e622fca-94a2-4396-a1a5-ea73ab3bdaa3" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-b764fa09-1cbf-4a69-b56a-386366ae1dba" facs="#m-07388c7a-3a84-488a-a6ee-170f6a851c7b" label="lyrics-like">DTans a déxtris é-jus* Agnus níve candí-di-or,</l><l xml:id="m-59cf3078-7bc7-4414-99da-164459c7dc8d" facs="#m-cd78ca71-fba8-4dc8-aa6d-9cc884312145" label="lyrics-like">Chrístus sí-bi spónsam et mártyrem consecrá-vit.</l><l xml:id="m-7c6f1155-e55e-4254-b2c4-14fa09f7016c" facs="#m-1db2dd85-6fa2-4009-8e01-ba726441171b" label="lyrics-like">V. Spécie túa et pulchritúdine túa.</l><l xml:id="m-992b7131-8243-4d95-b713-7fa2e4c6f5a8" facs="#m-1ea613ef-19be-4bb0-869e-674ac62ea662" label="lyrics-like">R. Inténde, próspere procéde, et régna.</l><l xml:id="m-b7755bbf-5723-4330-a01c-4902902fea13" facs="#m-46c97d93-32f0-403f-a68e-5de9e089c5cd" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3a799c24-3c35-44d2-839a-86aa22f5ab8d" facs="#m-0457ba09-fa82-4b9d-be57-086c1f114d29" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos ánnua beátae! quaésumus; ut quam venerámur</l><l xml:id="m-700150a1-2b4f-4275-8701-b86aea4f8852" facs="#m-44946591-82f4-4769-95d8-37d070ae4cdf" label="lyrics-like">UAgnétis Virginis et Mártyris ] officio,* étiam piae conversatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-8c34163f-b630-461b-895d-4c311ceba4da" facs="#m-ec5ea912-943d-4703-ae2a-52a01ec73507" label="lyrics-like">tuae solemnitâte laetíficas: t dal sequámur exémplo. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-546f5fdc-c2a8-40a5-9a32-7e83f9d92caa" facs="#m-e0908679-6a8a-450c-a6e8-a1a2a357a062" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-3a5b0711-8365-40df-ac32-36a7422ec4c4" facs="#m-35f863f7-281f-474f-b0eb-7e08e88486f7" label="lyrics-like">Uper has, quaésumus Dómine,] nobis cleménter operétur, et de</l><l xml:id="m-9f8d6a50-297a-4fdb-8402-5feccfd511bb" facs="#m-a83bd5af-69d2-4a77-b884-59c1cdc084a5" label="lyrics-like">D hõstias benedictio copiósa de-lMártyrum nos solemnitáte laeti¬</l><l xml:id="m-58a57759-fbd7-4334-9638-c60936e9c8ad" facs="#m-c0d06e6a-34d9-473c-8847-5d0487a71021" label="lyrics-like">scéndat: quae et sanctificatiónem! ficet. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a4b2118e-851c-4df1-bbdf-4b9c6da27878" facs="#m-6c1cafbf-de9d-4fac-b161-282554546ed0" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-86f8d4f5-1405-424f-ba54-714da0adc2c6" facs="#m-9f9026da-3919-44f0-a749-6b3adf13e6ff" label="lyrics-like">YUmpsimus, Dómine, celebritátis! lis vitae nobis remédia praébeant,</l><l xml:id="m-306f5a3b-b47e-4e39-a767-aaa7c1fc9bf3" facs="#m-6dc5c393-9851-4e8c-b1ca-8a071b777e58" label="lyrics-like">D ánnuae votiva sacraménta: et aetérnae. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-46a484d6-a1aa-4b33-b983-54f0767c8f2c" facs="#m-492bccfe-cc1b-4884-8862-5dd7f27c8530" label="lyrics-like">praesta, quaésumus; ut et temporá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2711b44a-83c7-4941-aa41-ba2d05475ff5" facs="#m-53647b0c-50ec-4ef0-97d5-7d17074f6dd5" label="text-like">St. Francis of Sales, Bishop, Confessor,</l><l xml:id="m-92a8a388-5b4e-4a73-985b-ba5a266838b7" facs="#m-288ca854-e432-49c2-8ac0-aaeba38fb485" label="ambiguous">29.</l><l xml:id="m-affb3a29-10f5-4f5e-b6f5-54f9243a221d" facs="#m-ae87b93c-6ea2-4cf2-aa4c-58289951ac45" label="text-like">and Doctor of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-892480f3-c32c-4376-a65b-12ea36f07104" facs="#m-3176b6c0-c6be-4668-b823-af82a076e8dc" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-b5cea4f8-0e5c-4e3f-a82b-461b93b0b385" facs="#m-051bda9e-d185-4153-a4e3-41782ba1294c" label="lyrics-like">At Ist and 2nd Vespers. At Magn. Ant. O Dóctor... beáte Francísce.</l><l xml:id="m-c4c2856a-aca7-4954-8e47-02aa1b8503b1" facs="#m-7fef2eea-d265-41ad-840b-1040acd8f785" label="ambiguous">p. 202a.</l><l xml:id="m-600ca656-261b-4662-824f-aca90b7cb31c" facs="#m-2865f92c-cce0-4135-84c4-cb4ac7ab5ea5" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio. from the Common of Doctors, p. 1190, except the</l><l xml:id="m-9cddc37f-b446-46e0-9b66-f30f7f6c3913" facs="#m-538f0b1e-d9f6-4edc-a280-f12ee8a3e382" label="ambiguous">following:</l><l xml:id="m-75d0e474-acf1-4d9e-98d6-b83b239fc7ea" facs="#m-2a89ce61-bfb7-4b8f-93d7-cf3cca37b565" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-7c7bcaef-115a-4790-b69b-bfad532d898a" facs="#m-d33dea09-f244-44bc-8577-23ba127fd1fc" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ad animárum salútem! dulcédine perfúsi, * ejus dirigénti¬</l><l xml:id="m-157c3d4d-83ac-4597-a404-1d08d57d3884" facs="#m-8c27e5a0-cf7a-4b64-81bb-6f293fc124d1" label="lyrics-like">I beátum Franciscum Confessó¬</l><l xml:id="m-21a3d318-ecad-40ee-b478-44aa3c6e25d9" facs="#m-eab73cea-087d-47f6-9dde-72a693790497" label="lyrics-like">bus mónitis ac suffragántibus méri¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ba1b47f-6d96-4542-a734-cd491d19d9de" facs="#m-7813eb06-ae72-4e61-9269-8970e76d0b47" label="lyrics-like">tis, aetérna gáudia consequámur.</l><l xml:id="m-067a8f47-b2d8-41a5-b7bb-b856fe952fc5" facs="#m-ed8835ff-39e7-445f-9e1a-aa0a81904fa7" label="lyrics-like">rem tuum atque Pontíficem, ómni¬</l><l xml:id="m-fcc11662-1b37-4ef2-99ce-f83225c7380a" facs="#m-679d99e9-5518-4401-9196-1dc029e6b158" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-622c7d82-330b-4b19-9d24-432e426162ae" facs="#m-7ab0aabc-1648-46be-84ac-11f383ec97c1" label="lyrics-like">bus ómnia factum esse voluisti:t</l><l xml:id="m-83292966-48f7-4f0c-b716-06981afe8f19" facs="#m-b0b3a5b1-c70d-4e6b-b08b-2747bf296b00" label="lyrics-like">concéde propitius; ut caritátis tuae</l><l xml:id="m-ef1a1c17-5393-4e8f-b17b-97144ad6afce" facs="#m-d4e2111a-da98-4cfe-aed9-25c00845ec45" label="text-like">The Credo is said.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>